      "created_at": "2020-10-27T11:30:20.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So long story short: Brawl is one of the very cool games in the Cheapass Games catalogue, a real-time card game styled after fighting games. I got into it because of the Dicebreaker video on it:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=sL2y8BCgZwU\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=sL2y8BCgZwU</a></p>\n<p>Anyway, now that GtG are handling (or will be handling?) the Cheapass catalogue, it seemed appropriate to make some decks for Sentinels characters. So, I drew up the following:</p>\n<p>Fanatic:<br>\nBases x4<br>\nClear x2<br>\nPress x2<br>\nRed Hit x4<br>\nBlue Hit x9<br>\nGreen Hit x5<br>\nBlue 2-Hit x2<br>\nGreen 2-Hit x1<br>\nRed Block x1<br>\nGreen Block x2<br>\nFreeze x3</p>\n<p>Tachyon:<br>\nBases x6<br>\nClear x3<br>\nRed Hit x6<br>\nBlue Hit x7<br>\nGreen Hit x8<br>\nBlue Block x2<br>\nFreeze x3</p>\n<p>People who know Brawl: any thoughts? Have I made Tachyon ludicrously OP?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:54:25.873Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
