      "raw": "<p>So long story short: Brawl is one of the very cool games in the Cheapass Games catalogue, a real-time card game styled after fighting games. I got into it because of the Dicebreaker video on it:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=sL2y8BCgZwU\">https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=sL2y8BCgZwU</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Anyway, now that GtG are handling (or will be handling?) the Cheapass catalogue, it seemed appropriate to make some decks for Sentinels characters. So, I drew up the following:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Fanatic:<br />\r\nBases x4<br />\r\nClear x2<br />\r\nPress x2<br />\r\nRed Hit x4<br />\r\nBlue Hit x9<br />\r\nGreen Hit x5<br />\r\nBlue 2-Hit x2<br />\r\nGreen 2-Hit x1<br />\r\nRed Block x1<br />\r\nGreen Block x2<br />\r\nFreeze x3</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tachyon:<br />\r\nBases x6<br />\r\nClear x3<br />\r\nRed Hit x6<br />\r\nBlue Hit x7<br />\r\nGreen Hit x8<br />\r\nBlue Block x2<br />\r\nFreeze x3</p>\r\n\r\n<p>People who know Brawl: any thoughts? Have I made Tachyon ludicrously OP?</p>",
